# SQL Injection Detection SPL Queries

# Primary detection query
index=* sourcetype=flask ("--" OR "' OR" OR "1=1")

# Log-source enumeration query
source="flask.log" ("--" OR "' OR" OR "1=1")

# Notes:
# - Adjust index and sourcetype to match your Splunk configuration.
# - These queries are based on the lab patterns documented in the project.
# - Do not treat simple string matching as a complete production SQLi detection strategy.
